1
00:00:01,764 --> 00:00:04,434
Makise Kurisu!

2
00:00:05,184 --> 00:00:07,234
I did knock, for what it's worth.

3
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:08,984
How did you find this place?

4
00:00:09,504 --> 00:00:11,484
I asked Hashida-san.

5
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:13,404
He called it a "laboratory,"

6
00:00:13,404 --> 00:00:15,404
so I was expecting something more than this...

7
00:00:15,404 --> 00:00:17,364
Daru, did you betray me?

8
00:00:18,664 --> 00:00:21,534
You were deceived by this three-dimensional woman's wiles...

9
00:00:21,534 --> 00:00:25,504
I'll never forgive you! Ever!

10
00:00:25,504 --> 00:00:26,294
You... You...

11
00:00:26,294 --> 00:00:28,084
Bitch!

12
00:00:28,084 --> 00:00:30,254
Can you do anything about him?

13
00:00:30,254 --> 00:00:32,504
Just think of him as confused by events.

14
00:00:33,134 --> 00:00:34,554
This is an emergency.

15
00:00:35,014 --> 00:00:38,474
The Organization finally sent an agent to the lab!

16
00:00:38,474 --> 00:00:39,344
What?

17
00:00:39,344 --> 00:00:41,644
Then this, too, is the choice of Steins Gate?

18
00:00:42,094 --> 00:00:43,224
Steins Gate?

19
00:00:43,224 --> 00:00:45,144
Something Okarin made up.

20
00:00:45,144 --> 00:00:46,394
It doesn't really mean anything.

21
00:00:47,054 --> 00:00:48,194
I'm sure.

22
00:00:48,194 --> 00:00:50,444
He's mixing up his German and English.

23
00:00:51,444 --> 00:00:53,074
Take your shoes off!

24
00:00:53,804 --> 00:00:55,574
I'm sorry.

25
00:00:55,574 --> 00:00:57,404
I've been in America too long.

26
00:01:00,384 --> 00:01:01,494
Nice to meet you.

27
00:01:01,874 --> 00:01:03,084
I'm Makise Kurisu.

28
00:01:05,294 --> 00:01:06,704
You can't even shake hands?

29
00:01:07,164 --> 00:01:10,254
Japanese men don't know how to do anything.

30
00:01:13,474 --> 00:01:14,384
You're freaking out too much.

31
00:01:16,214 --> 00:01:19,054
It's because I can feel murderous intent seeping from your every pore.

32
00:01:19,054 --> 00:01:21,844
Is this what they call the "martial arts"?

33
00:01:24,554 --> 00:01:25,604
Where are you going?

34
00:01:26,024 --> 00:01:30,274
Honestly, I came here to see if your claim that I was stabbed was real

35
00:01:30,274 --> 00:01:32,234
or just an excuse for sexual harassment.

36
00:01:32,614 --> 00:01:37,494
But this is more important.

37
00:01:51,354 --> 00:01:51,554
suujuuoku mo no kodou no kazu sae

38
00:01:51,354 --> 00:01:57,024
Even the number of several billion heartbeats

